# Section typography

Use `SectionHeading` from `@/components/section-heading` for gold-eyebrow section titles.

## Pattern

- **Eyebrow:** Inter, 15px, semibold, `tracking-[0.10em]`, gold
- **Title:** Inter sans-serif, semibold — never `font-serif` / Playfair for section titles
- **Desktop:** one line via `lg:whitespace-nowrap` (default on `SectionHeading`)
- **Mobile/tablet:** normal wrap when text does not fit

## Do not

- Use `font-serif`, `font-normal`, or `max-w-3xl` on section titles that should match site pattern
- Hand-roll eyebrow + h2 pairs when `SectionHeading` fits

## Exceptions

- Hero `h1` blocks (light/bold mix on imagery)
- Decorative serif quote marks in testimonials
- Page-level navy eyebrows (`text-navy`, larger sizes) on about hero sections
